  "user_solution": "/*\n - identical `case_number`, `payer_id`, and `provider_npi` but submission_id\n\nFor each duplicate set (same `case_number`, `payer_id`, `provider_npi`), keep only the submission with the lowest `submission_id` and delete all others.\nKEEP LOWEST\n\n\n\n*/\n\nDELETE FROM prior_auth_submissions\nWHERE submission_id not in (SELECT MIN(submission_id) FROM prior_auth_submissions GROUP BY case_number, payer_id, provider_npi);\n\nSELECT * FROM prior_auth_submissions ORDER BY submission_id;\n\n",
